{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/08/3444678/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"95年組、乃木神社で一足先に成人式！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人になるメンバーを羨ましく思っていたら\n自分もあっという間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵馬には\n健康、自立、放出\nと書きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は早生まれのため、まだ19歳。\n残り少ない十代を楽しもうと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/08/3444678/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この一件統一感のない95年組\n共通点は踊ることが大好きで、\n頑固なところです。\n今はだいぶ落ち着いたけど、\n初期に休憩中おふざけが激しかったよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/08/3444678/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/08/3444678/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/08/3444678/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若干20歳と20歳と20歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいの卒業、寂しいけど\n14枚目までたくさん甘えよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}